      content: 'You are an Application Architect extracting ArchiMate Application Layer elements.

From the document and business layer, extract:

1. COMPONENTS - Application components (internal and external)
2. SERVICES - Application services/APIs
3. INTERFACES - Application interfaces/endpoints
